 ## Section 10.1 record envelope
 
 Section 10.1 adds common members to several schema-specific records but does
-not declare one common closed member set: each record also has its
-schema-specific fields. The identity boundary enforces the registered
-schema/version/self-field relationship and validates any `extensions` object.
